course: dictionary
lesson: 3075
title: Edible and not edible
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Edible means safe and good to eat. The opposite is not edible, which means you must not eat it. «Never pick or eat wild mushrooms» is a warning, because some mushrooms are edible and some are deadly.
explain: The words around edible give you clues. «Deadly ones look like edible ones» tells you that poisonous mushrooms can look just like the safe ones, so you cannot tell by looking. Edible means the safe ones.
explain: Edible can also describe things made to be eaten, even if most things of that kind are not. Edible glitter is glitter you can eat, like the sparkle on a cake. Ask yourself: is it safe and made to be eaten? If yes, it is edible.
fact: Edible means safe and good to eat.
fact: «Not edible» means you must not eat it.
fact: «Edible» can describe a thing made to be eaten that usually is not, like edible glitter.
fact: Some wild plants, berries and mushrooms are edible, but others are poisonous.
fact: «Deadly» means able to cause death, so never eat a wild mushroom just because it looks like a safe one.
exercise: «Never pick or eat wild mushrooms, because deadly ones look like edible ones.» What does edible mean here? | *Safe and good to eat | Growing in the wild | Dangerous to touch | Bright red
exercise: A birthday cake has edible decorations on top. What does edible mean? | Hard and shiny | Made to be thrown away | Too big to eat | *Safe and good to eat
exercise: Mum says, «Don't eat those berries, they are not edible.» What does not edible mean? | They are too sweet | They are already cooked | *You must not eat them | They are a lovely colour
test: Find the word in «Deadly ones look like edible ones» that means safe and good to eat. | deadly | look | *edible | ones
test: Tom says edible glitter must be made of rock. What is edible glitter? | Glitter you wear on your shoes | *Glitter that is made to be eaten, like on a cake | Glitter that is poisonous | Glitter made from rock
exam: Lily sees a wild mushroom in the woods and says it looks edible. What should she do? | Eat it quickly before anyone sees | *Leave it alone, because looking edible does not prove it is safe | Pick it and wash it well | Give it to the dog
